1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,710
You wake up at seven in the morning,

2
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:03,330
and floating in front of your

3
00:00:03,330 --> 00:00:05,250
chest is a translucent menu.

4
00:00:05,970 --> 00:00:06,930
Save point created.

5
00:00:07,790 --> 00:00:09,290
At first, you think you're still dreaming.

6
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:10,990
You swipe your hand through it,

7
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:14,050
but your fingers buzz with a mild electric hum.

8
00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:16,670
Then small text appears beneath it:

9
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:19,150
Tap your wrists together twice to reload.

10
00:00:19,890 --> 00:00:20,650
You look out the window.

11
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:22,010
The streets are moving,

12
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:22,950
buses are running,

13
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:24,930
the world is completely normal.

14
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:26,090
Except for you.

15
00:00:26,590 --> 00:00:27,870
For the next seven days,

16
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:29,970
you have one active save point.
